  "releaseNotes": "**DI015 Generic Host lifetime service fidelity** — `Microsoft.Extensions.Hosting.IHostLifetime`, which the Generic Host registers as a singleton, now participates in the default framework-services assumption alongside `IHostApplicationLifetime`. Strict mode, same-named user types, and keyed requests still report; shared dependency analysis now preserves the key and lets explicit registrations override ambient framework lifetimes, so scoped `IHostLifetime` replacements remain visible to DI019 and DI020.",
